# Line endings: everything text is LF in the repository and in the working tree, on every platform.
# An import's files are checked byte for byte against their ORIGIN, and the pre-push hook and
# interface/pull.sh are shell scripts; a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true would turn the one
# into a failed check and the others into scripts bash cannot run. (What an edition takes is fetched
# from GitHub at a merged commit, never from this working tree.)
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
.githooks/* text eol=lf
ORIGIN text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary
